{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_title", "source_sha256": "7bb5f918afc27909a4d4baac5b0e93a743303d519c0ac6d9d7b0a43ed9ed80ef", "ja": "杏奈", "zh": "杏奈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f51609262cc07c443499bfaea13f9566111d925659716115eea938e37034fc14", "ja": "オン状態が続く杏奈のリフレッシュのため\n遊園地にきた瑞希、海美、茜、亜美、杏奈。\nアトラクションを全力で楽しんだ後、杏奈は\nプロデューサーと言葉を交わすことで安心し\n無事オフ状態に戻れるようになるのだった。", "zh": "为了让一直保持开启模式的杏奈转换心情，\n瑞希、海美、茜、亚美和杏奈来到了游乐园。\n尽情畅玩游乐设施后，杏奈与制作人\n交谈了一番，心里终于感到安心，\n也顺利地能够切换回关闭模式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60c1fd78cead2cd48de89490067028a0ce4f3ac5df012473b1c89f3214cdd378", "ja": "（オン状態の杏奈をリフレッシュさせるため、\n休みをとって遊びに来た！　場所は……）", "zh": "（为了让处于上线状态的杏奈恢复精神，特意请了假来游玩！地点是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6084c26f89fdec58f5408931c383ec53d4271faa85679505277e32e45edf5a8", "ja": "気持ちいいくらいの、晴れだーっ！\n絶好の遊園地日和になってよかった～♪", "zh": "晴得让人心情舒畅——！\n能变成最适合去游乐园的好天气，真是太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "9882bd8e47d8519b7edd639e1f5b15805cf215965365d4b5868287c14c26a966", "ja": "ここ、丸一日遊べるくらい大きいんだよね！\nさすが茜ちん、いいチョイスですな～。", "zh": "这里大到足够玩上一整天呢！\n不愧是茜亲，选得真好～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e2617acafd2744167e4291bb884110ff7ffaf43db81a2fefc41ec0ec94dc5abf", "ja": "ふっふっふ。何を隠そう、このテーマパークの\nアンバサダーを務めたのは茜ちゃんだからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿。说起来，担任这个主题乐园大使的可是小茜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "e37b8cf3b5746875dbf2aa61ea0ec124589f6c552421bdb78774134a8800b6f8", "ja": "マスコットのネコちゃんは、茜ちゃんも一目置く\nレベルだよ。絶対癒されるんじゃないかな♪", "zh": "吉祥物猫咪的水平，就连小茜也不得不刮目相看哦。肯定能治愈人心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "1ec38ad3fa384b890d0c4c38efeafba608bad07519ef5606254f10d90377647e", "ja": "野々原さんがそこまで断言するとは、\n興味があります。……モフモフ、したい。", "zh": "没想到野野原小姐会断言到这种程度，我有些感兴趣了。……想摸摸那毛茸茸的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7bd11e7f7ed97c44f36937b6aac292baffe5de3fd36fee9d0159cfeadb8e52f", "ja": "えへへ。杏奈、こんな風に友達と遊園地来ること、\nあんまりなかったかも……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。杏奈好像还不太常有机会这样和朋友一起来游乐园……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c7d11f26284a2f702e8bdd8f4141d09a805a86b94745236b1793054bc717d5c", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん！\n今日は思いっきり楽しんでみるね！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n杏奈今天会尽情玩个痛快的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dfdcabac1cba1e62b21351b61cfa42b2297868fe37a8cb31b4528e291228adb8", "ja": "うん、それがいい。……でも、リフレッシュなら\n俺はいない方がよかったんじゃないか……？", "zh": "嗯，那样挺好的。……不过既然是散心，\n我是不是不在场会更好啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "3be019b45bca2945a82113a2c7a0120c2280775a0f79086324ba2235da7fa8b3", "ja": "ダメ！　{$P$}さんも\n今日は一日、杏奈に付き合って！", "zh": "不行！{$P$}先生今天也要陪杏奈一整天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1010_p", "source_sha256": "786b743b855e557c1e08a30fb003ab9a48d50b129596c20a3c0c11818299aa90", "ja": "そ、そうか……わかった！　俺も今日は休日だし、\n杏奈と一緒にリフレッシュするぞ！", "zh": "那、这样啊……知道了！我今天也休息，\n就和杏奈一起放松一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed6b3d58a5168c5d02563578a97e5a361fc1c1e28abcf40383fe44f50e522688", "ja": "イエイ！　そうこなくっちゃね☆\nそれじゃあ早速、全力で遊びまわっちゃおう！", "zh": "耶！就该这样嘛☆\n那我们马上就尽情玩个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "73d8f1b174aa1e776e3e92f2389404a5835423082f692b9605938872072e104e", "ja": "もっちー、今日は遊園地での\n『うみみん式スイッチオフ作戦』教えてあげる！", "zh": "饼饼，今天我就教你游乐园里的\n“海美式关机大作战”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "113b9d02d0bb537966e183900cf34430e31cd80e20e3c463a350da5d56a08c17", "ja": "えっ。海美さんも\nスイッチオフする時があるの！？", "zh": "诶。海美小姐也会有切换成放松模式的时候吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "7bc6a471b424bd7ae7501c56049a24fd9c3904a6fa6ca5598c4a3f3e9c3c47a5", "ja": "もちろんだよ～！\nほら、歌もダンスもメリハリが大事でしょ？", "zh": "当然啦～！\n你看，唱歌和跳舞都很讲究张弛有度，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "6fd37f20e70da258a9f1c20c09df7b9a3ba62eb736034880943793d6ca8b55b8", "ja": "というわけで、もっちー、私についてきてね！\nまずは～、あの絶叫マシンから！", "zh": "所以说，茂千代，跟紧我哦！\n首先——就从那台尖叫系游乐设施开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "ceedb461fa51e783910542050d2379ed955388f435225d4e3979c4f6be941e85", "ja": "ふう～、面白かったー☆　目につく絶叫マシン、\n手あたり次第乗ったし……前半戦はこんなもんかな！", "zh": "呼——真有意思～☆ 看到的刺激项目，我都一个不落地坐过了……前半场就到这里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4de8ac4a3ac124873779bc83c28e0a79c84db983054e4d839e7aae282e35287e", "ja": "ぜえ、ぜえ……っ！　ち、ちょっと待ってくれ！\nすこし、休憩を……！", "zh": "呼、呼……！等、等一下！\n让我休息一会儿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "a9e75967dce613a5d553c8d5a7de54f5732d4e4601b15379e25c3814ad8af58a", "ja": "情けないなー、兄ちゃん。\nまだ絶叫マシン5台目だよ？", "zh": "真没出息啊，哥哥。\n这才是第5台尖叫机器哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "a002e97255c2a3f9f52b2c311c4802bb0dc408aec818f6f7d54841b08aa5228a", "ja": "杏奈、2番目に乗ったコースターが面白かったな～。\nグルグル回ってビビッと光ったりして、最高☆", "zh": "杏奈，坐第2个过山车时觉得很有意思呢～。转来转去，还会闪闪发光，太棒了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "cedb65d96633acdc699c27389f11208eaea544a7babc230c184acf5d41e08390", "ja": "おお！　もっちー、いけるクチじゃん！\nあれは絶叫マシン特集の常連アトラクションだかんね！", "zh": "哦！小杏，原来你挺能坐这种的嘛！那可是尖叫系游乐设施特辑里的常客项目呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "b10adc79baba6448e1ba52c58abc23d9a670c08486cce87699b07cfc7b99fb85", "ja": "『衝撃！　未体験の18回転スクリュー！』って\nやつね……。茜ちゃん、乗らないでよかったよ……。", "zh": "就是那个《冲击！从未体验过的18回旋螺旋！》……。小茜，还好你没坐上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "74242bdcff9c64762ba71d2630299607df793253c605bedee262b63d6c29a34c", "ja": "私もです。外から見ているだけで、\n目が回りかけました。", "zh": "我也是。光是从外面看着，就差点看晕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "32d721ba94d60d72e16f5dc5ee8ebd5073b13c636afd05ef96186d425d8c7139", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……\nもしかして、気持ち悪くなった？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n难道是觉得不舒服了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8e392293064f820a9b6cc482e3e13a2705d52dfff79c91611e5673ee0a6fff28", "ja": "い、いや……大丈夫だよ。疲労はしたけど。\n未知の経験で、まさにリフレッシュできたと思う！", "zh": "不、不是……我没事。虽然确实累到了。\n但这是一次未知的体验，真的让我彻底放松下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8fbd9020d32d754a6641c434648b95b1f16897595aa13696ac153261ea07a910", "ja": "でも海美、絶叫マシンに乗りまくって\nどうして『スイッチオフ』できるんだ……？", "zh": "不过海美，你坐了那么多次刺激的游乐设施，怎么还能“关掉开关”啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5b190dc9475ec7fbab161ba28f3488dd280436c3813bd7ca8f9b8eb635c9eea", "ja": "えっとね、体力を使い果たした日は、\nスイッチが切れたみたいによく眠れるでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊，用光体力的那天，就会像关掉开关一样睡得特别香，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab1afdf64a4fa0c1fca2dec14edc5f19195daf5d8f52d5ca47b94d8952eb3fd6", "ja": "だから、とにかく体力を使い切るまで遊ぶ！\nそれが『うみみん式スイッチオフ』！", "zh": "所以，总之就是要玩到精疲力竭！\n这就是“海美式关机”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9e528a1330aa6f5b1d223f477b92548a0c855f0ad26fe6b084013a6bc59625a8", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか……。\nすごく海美らしい方法だな……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……\n真是非常符合海美风格的方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "40a4c4f603f206a9bc7a10a321bfb262f033420cdd256ecb48c392fefcb9f9a8", "ja": "そういうことでしたら……体力と一緒に、\n知力も使ってみてはどうでしょう？", "zh": "如果是这样……不妨试试看，除了体力以外，\n也运用一下智力怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "0758ae44f62be223371d27381ecbbfa7b1476fe5ba8efafa8fc17fcb86f48916", "ja": "この遊園地で、脱出もののイベントが\n開催されているそうです。……挑戦者、求む。", "zh": "听说这座游乐园正在举办逃脱类活动。……征集挑战者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d4486d389b4bf785989ffd7734699392148e2ec6bf7d816d2d4ca464c3bb222f", "ja": "チラシが配られてたのか。どれどれ……\n脱出イベント『ダンジョンからの誘い』……。", "zh": "原来是在发传单啊。让我看看……\n\n逃脱活动《来自地牢的邀请》……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "e4162e2c256392129be134b9bb8cc1accb56a38c98114196b1800ff8a031a32e", "ja": "『ダンジョンからの誘い』……！\nいいね！　すっごく面白そう☆", "zh": "《来自迷宫的邀请》……！\n不错！看起来超级有意思☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "b9a2d14f848eee40a3ced312ec8f63a082c37e3e8cf2605b883088d44b108cbb", "ja": "そっか、体も頭も使うほうが疲れるもんね！", "zh": "这样啊，果然身体和脑子都要用上的话，会更累呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccabffa6fb27f7ef7f4597e804ab62ac5a6acce2ae9a9b9e69281503bdb03880", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん。脱出イベント！\n茜ちゃんの文武両道っぷり、見せちゃおうかニャ☆", "zh": "挺不错嘛，挺不错嘛。密室逃脱活动！\n就让大家看看小茜文武双全的风采吧喵☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "6861743212c144b011672546d5ef787c8cc8660f0dbaf521f708f9bf48fb920d", "ja": "そうと決まれば……、兄ちゃん！　へばってないで、\nチケットプリーズ！　大人6枚ね♪", "zh": "既然决定了……哥哥！别累趴下，票票请给我！成人6张哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1037_p", "source_sha256": "34e512ecd24ad215f94a429ed84e142d7385c1d5c6c4273494b4188f5196196b", "ja": "わかったわかった。時間はあるんだ、こうなったら\n絶叫マシンも脱出イベントも、全部こなそう！", "zh": "知道了知道了。反正还有时间，既然都这样了，\n尖叫系游乐设施和逃脱活动，全都玩一遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1038_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f95829b010295aec54ee551523cc330b74f08eed694f46653802cd010387f58a", "ja": "（日が暮れるまでみんな本当によく遊んだな。\n最後は、杏奈の希望で観覧車へ……）", "zh": "（大家真的一直玩到天黑呢。\n最后按照杏奈的愿望，去坐了摩天轮……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "b356b3adcac8cced1f100aafcdbe1a558b2cb77647b99aefc655a9f637bf2e17", "ja": "はあ、今日はすっごく楽しかった～！", "zh": "哈，今天真的玩得超开心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "59554e1fed7ef4875cd4d3b89b72136620daa6a22e68954c873085408a2435b6", "ja": "絶叫マシンも脱出イベントも、遊園地のゲーム\nセンターでも遊んだし……杏奈、大満足です！", "zh": "尖叫系游乐设施也玩了，密室逃脱活动也参加了，游乐园的游戏厅也玩了……杏奈非常满足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1042_p", "source_sha256": "cde4b74f4cb72c425271f74e33cc04b32a1c4bba8ccd65e749b8f0a8a17c7618", "ja": "休みを満喫したみたいだな。\nそれだったらなによりだ。", "zh": "看样子你充分享受了假期啊。\n那就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "6e5ca02e90ddd912e88fff543b9ba7d3f7e9e45b568aa0df7b4bcd3385d06f89", "ja": "うん！　杏奈、今日でビビッと充電できました！\nまた明日からいっぱい、アイドルのお仕事したいな☆", "zh": "嗯！杏奈今天已经充满活力了！\n明天开始也想做很多偶像的工作呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1044_p", "source_sha256": "8691e4c225010bd98981acfb84b92addcc80fffbc1f83302595b112450fbd4d6", "ja": "一応、新曲公演の予定はあるけどな。\n杏奈のための新曲を作ってるんだ。", "zh": "总之，新曲公演是有安排的。\n正在为杏奈创作新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "f68c58590298978f725ff17dbdf335867c72497371175e1dd9c715af44aedfbb", "ja": "えっ！　杏奈、新曲もらえるの……！？\nイエーーーーイ！！！", "zh": "诶！杏奈也能拿到新歌吗……！？\n耶————！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "723e7d537a936547774a25d134bf98a88d72a493056486b03c9a05b8f031c916", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん！\n杏奈、頑張るね！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n杏奈会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1047_p", "source_sha256": "5e864a62b6ac8ef63c3bfd382ecffe9d0e2967541edff1dc9ea9363f2b5fa9fb", "ja": "どういたしまして。でも、新曲公演は\n杏奈がオフに戻れるようになってからかな。", "zh": "不客气。不过，新曲公演还是等杏奈能恢复休息之后再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1048_024ann", "source_sha256": "9efb6ba217fcbbe7f3509710e2735f9194e476ec991d5315fbf6a261d7b7bd92", "ja": "杏奈が、オフに……？", "zh": "杏奈要恢复休息状态……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1049_p", "source_sha256": "9c28f923884be8dca9fbc971a2e9ef0e628e5384b642dbfab3c5e6e68243df21", "ja": "うん、今日のリフレッシュも、\nそのためだっただろう？", "zh": "嗯，今天放松休整，\n也是为了这个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "163533286136430d2c018bde9972f2a8d5aa69bc7d0aef25106c5f09fb68e6d0", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さんは……\nオフの杏奈のほうが、すき……ですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生是……\n你更喜欢休息时的杏奈……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "038147ed05e1abb083edb3ceea9feab3bdb0533004e111f30f3f0e81149a389d", "ja": "今の……元気な杏奈より、\n静かな杏奈のほうが……。", "zh": "比起现在……充满活力的杏奈，\n您更喜欢安静的杏奈……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1053_p", "source_sha256": "a362e555e2d2cd81a144e08a0e63e4692ae0c203453a5e653862670323f43e41", "ja": "とんでもない。\n今の杏奈も、とっても魅力的だよ。", "zh": "才不是呢。\n现在这样的杏奈，也非常有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1054_p", "source_sha256": "93431a618b86388761bdd9ff7099d4565d925a045240c0dc44d156142acb7bbd", "ja": "元気な杏奈は、とにかくキラキラ輝いて……\n見る人を離さない不思議な力がある。すごく素敵だ。", "zh": "活泼的杏奈总是闪闪发光……\n有一种不可思议的力量，让看到她的人移不开视线。真的很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1055_024ann", "source_sha256": "d112e973dae9197d6803bd2d8c9a0ddf9ca1070e242e2db82b860526bc2d5a2d", "ja": "えっと……。えへへっ、よかったです♪\n……あのっ……。", "zh": "那个……诶嘿嘿，太好了♪\n……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1056_024ann", "source_sha256": "b5b29fa66b1ead523514124278ae9983e4066c14db274add53842b4890f61a2f", "ja": "杏奈ね、アイドルになりたくて……\nひとりでアイドルのマネをして……。", "zh": "杏奈啊，想成为偶像……\n所以就一个人模仿偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1057_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b118830733716b1d28f6d6a6c242fd2d3e92c684fcd4302c22c4d88f0569f0e", "ja": "そしたら、{$P$}さんに\n見つけてもらって……覚えてる？", "zh": "然后，{$P$}先生发现了我……你还记得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1058_p", "source_sha256": "422d16d0a3bb809617047aca0c16d62d77f54e32ef0d2c4832cb061f4efe4749", "ja": "もちろん覚えてるよ。\n校舎の裏で、ステージを開いてたな。", "zh": "当然记得了。\n你当时在教学楼后面开演唱会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1059_024ann", "source_sha256": "b1feb3f0e9668735240d4b97beb62bc39c2227c458df3c9405ea94f9574d29e0", "ja": "杏奈、劇場に来て、本当にアイドルになれて……。\nアイドルの、いろんなお仕事をして……。", "zh": "来到剧场后，杏奈真的成为偶像了……  \n还做了偶像的各种工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1060_024ann", "source_sha256": "1bf4f96614fd2c5fa90b4154a8d8c824212f33fa27d87cf91b30ed374fa57b8a", "ja": "それで、アイドルが……キラキラな杏奈が……\nすこし、上手になった気がするの。だから……。", "zh": "所以……做偶像……成为闪闪发光的杏奈……好像稍微变得更得心应手了。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1061_024ann", "source_sha256": "dbca8c3ed06676a390b3d9d87f499bc680e4d0a54c24023d6ad47b6bc8633df2", "ja": "だから、このままでいたくなったのかも……。", "zh": "所以……也许是想就这样一直下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1062_p", "source_sha256": "7ee9e15b83a4284069da4f61a6a4589a3bc9d9dcaf31d83d1a54e0485ac69a92", "ja": "そうか……。杏奈はきっと、\n自分をもっと広めたくなったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……杏奈一定是想让更多人认识自己了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1063_p", "source_sha256": "809c7de181663ad2977c44f58ec7645dc2858a8ed792c0d372e43832368d42be", "ja": "少しずつ自信がついた自分を、いろんな人に、\n世界中に届けたくなったんだと思う。", "zh": "我觉得是她想把逐渐有了自信的自己，展现给更多人、\n传递给全世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1064_024ann", "source_sha256": "146e2e8abf303edea8e1bad8d89967a2c93ed447ac3934ecca845095cc80f79e", "ja": "もっと、世界中に……。", "zh": "想要传达给全世界更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1065_p", "source_sha256": "3ed2554fe598c33ce7dcb88bc5657ea3b1adb77085deb4959354817db4c8b921", "ja": "ハイテンションが続くのも、体力がついてきたって\nことだと思う。杏奈は、立派に成長してるんだ。", "zh": "我觉得能一直保持高涨的情绪，也说明体力越来越好了。杏奈正在茁壮成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1066_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf6136b82eb577dd3b201338f935cc8e9c59c5619d61e0876c449853ba572c47", "ja": "……。\nでも……戻ったほうが、いい？", "zh": "……\n但是……还是恢复原状比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1067_024ann", "source_sha256": "2aa83ed2d7b848f2641ee22528784ab19f1f17b0440ef3c7d15750fab36a9f01", "ja": "やっぱり、オフの杏奈が……\n本当の杏奈ってこと、だから……？", "zh": "果然，因为OFF状态下的杏奈……\n才是真正的杏奈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1068_p", "source_sha256": "f8ae375008f919747c783c178ad566e5974d8b73007da2a329b06fd09ea26e6f", "ja": "杏奈に本当もウソもないよ。\nオンでもオフでも、杏奈は杏奈に決まってる。", "zh": "杏奈没有什么真实或虚假之分。\n无论是在台上还是台下，杏奈就是杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1069_p", "source_sha256": "f0abe94eb2a70b228dee062cdb53ab613ff469cc6a876267eeadb56de0241ae9", "ja": "もし、杏奈がずっとオンのままでいたいのなら\nそれでもいいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "如果杏奈想一直保持在线状态，我觉得那样也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1070_024ann", "source_sha256": "65d56182015ae94beecd711dbf9be5d7a8e052117bfbb57b023328b983b132df", "ja": "え？　そうなの……？\nでも、公演は……オフに戻れたらって……。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗……？\n不过，公演结束后……我还是想恢复成关机状态……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1071_p", "source_sha256": "1f9a273a15336cd518d088f7b11d766e79301f607ff7974f597739861d2ddb94", "ja": "うん。俺はただ、杏奈が戻りたいと思った時に、\n戻れるようになってほしいんだ。", "zh": "嗯。我只是希望杏奈想变回来的时候，\n就能变回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1072_p", "source_sha256": "3c007495f1eeeb8cdd7cabb1f32fd5eb5949debf5af7a4addc7c03ef8741c57e", "ja": "オンやオフを決めている杏奈……心の奥の杏奈が、\nいつでもどっちにでもなれるように。", "zh": "决定开启还是关闭的杏奈……希望内心深处的杏奈，随时都能变成其中任何一种状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_125_1073_p", "source_sha256": "154c2eba0e7d8a034071544cd11e98a634cbb1d8938a3d9d1410d3fe6e6c639a", "ja": "杏奈がいつ、どんな時でも、\n自分の好きな自分でいられるように。", "zh": "希望杏奈无论何时、无论在什么情况下，都能成为自己喜欢的那个自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
